---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Community & Collaboration | Governance Commons" description="How to review, critique and contribute to Governance Commons.">
  <section class="section white">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Community &amp; collaboration</p>
      <h1>Governance is stronger when its claims can be questioned.</h1>
      <p>Governance Commons is currently maintainer-led. We invite public scrutiny, implementation experience and constructive technical critique; this invitation is not a claim that a formal community or shared-stewardship program already exists.</p>
    </div>
    <img src="/assets/governance-hero-community-v1.png" alt="People reviewing governance evidence together around a table, representing the aspiration for collaborative scrutiny" style="display:block;width:100%;max-height:550px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:18px" />
    <div class="intro-grid" style="margin-top:32px">
      <article class="surface"><h2>Review the work</h2><p>Read the released specifications, evidence contracts, and current maturity labels.</p><a class="text-link" href="/#components">Explore components →</a></article>
      <article class="surface"><h2>Raise questions</h2><p>Examine public repositories and use their available discussion or issue channels where enabled.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/governancecommons">Visit GitHub →</a></article>
      <article class="surface"><h2>Explore the research</h2><p>Consider governance, legitimacy, accountability, human recourse and the social consequences of agent delegation.</p><a class="text-link" href="/#mission">Read the mission →</a></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>